Subject: [Traminer-users] How to keep the identifier (id) in the
	final	matrix cl1.4fac
In-Reply-To: <1976893853.52962158.1343137294134.JavaMail.root@zimbra8-e1.priv.proxad.net>
Message-ID: <1960894123.915070.1343138974452.JavaMail.root@clara>

Hi, 

if you don't sort the matrix you can save the id's in an external vector (standalone vector or dataframe's field). It's also possible to save the id's as matrix rownames, for example: 

rownames(matrix) <- dataframe$ID 

Hadrien 


